    <string name="guide">For screen-off use on ColorOS (OPPO) and HyperOS (Xiaomi):\n• Battery → set RideTalk to “No restrictions” / “Allow background activity”.\n• Enable Autostart for RideTalk.\n• Lock RideTalk in the recent-apps screen.\n• OPPO hotspot: turn off “Auto-disable hotspot when idle”.\n• Xiaomi: if Wi-Fi keeps switching to mobile data, disable “Wi-Fi assistant”.</string>
